[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14102.189, "timestamp": "03:55:02", "text": "好的。現在我們因為動漫而結緣，現在我們組建了團隊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14105.389, "timestamp": "03:55:05", "text": "不，謝謝。 我本來就打算這麼做。低設定。 所以在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14117.83, "timestamp": "03:55:17", "text": "我看來，它們看起來就像鉛筆。我拿走惠普。我正在做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14119.67, "timestamp": "03:55:19", "text": "。夥計們，我就是故意要出現在遊戲裡的。我們走吧。我該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14121.99, "timestamp": "03:55:21", "text": "離開嗎？不，不，先完成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14128.63, "timestamp": "03:55:28", "text": "。  我的天啊。我的天哪。這到底是什麼鬼東西？我現在都不知道該躲到哪裡去了。我可以躲在這裡嗎"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14134.263, "timestamp": "03:55:34", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I'd say ALWAYS"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14136.9, "timestamp": "03:55:36", "text": "？  我真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14143.229, "timestamp": "03:55:43", "text": "想拿回那筆錢"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14146.497, "timestamp": "03:55:46", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "even now"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14146.71, "timestamp": "03:55:46", "text": "。  我的天啊。你看起來更像是鬼魅的頭髮，伙計們。還有其他人嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14154.389, "timestamp": "03:55:54", "text": "？就在我們房間裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14157.51, "timestamp": "03:55:57", "text": "。沒關係。他逃跑了。伙計們，快點。快點。"}]